WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,160
What Sister Wang said makes sense

2
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:02,640
Seniors, don't waste your energy

3
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:04,160
Fill all the remaining empty bottles

4
00:00:04,960 --> 00:00:06,080
This is a bit of a job.

5
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:08,440
Wang Bao has been digging wild vegetables for eighteen years without your pretentiousness.

6
00:00:08,440 --> 00:00:09,360
Just say it if you feel wronged

7
00:00:09,360 --> 00:00:11,720
I used to show off my power and bully the weak at the base.

8
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:13,360
Now it's finally your turn to suffer

9
00:00:13,360 --> 00:00:14,280
Why cry?

10
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:15,600
I shed tears when I do some work

11
00:00:15,720 --> 00:00:16,880
If you want to cry, go out and cry

12
00:00:16,880 --> 00:00:18,000
Don't be annoying here.

13
00:00:22,340 --> 00:00:27,410
The days are getting more and more rebellious. It’s so bearish.

14
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:29,720
Help me move the water into the incubator

15
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,200
Just fill twenty bottles.

16
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:35,150
Boss Xia is planning to go out, right?

17
00:00:35,350 --> 00:00:36,910
I plan to go to the third base to have a look

18
00:00:37,190 --> 00:00:38,350
Boss Xia, be careful on the road

19
00:00:38,750 --> 00:00:40,230
Guests are out hunting every day

20
00:00:40,430 --> 00:00:42,190
If you encounter customers who have nowhere to go in the future,

21
00:00:42,190 --> 00:00:45,910
Please also ask the guests to recommend some good shops.

22
00:00:46,190 --> 00:00:47,110
I'm going out for a trip

23
00:00:47,630 --> 00:00:48,550
There are customers in the store

24
00:00:48,550 --> 00:00:49,550
Please help with reception
